{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Upon the bread</b> Twice in the Masorah: והקרבתם על הלחם שבעת כבשים and (the second occurrence). For \"not upon bread alone does man live\" (Deuteronomy 8:3) — therefore והקרבתם על הלחם שבעת כבשים, for the eating of the altar resembles the eating of man, as we say regarding libations: just as man's eating — eating exceeds drinking, etc."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:21.843934504Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}